              "audioEnd": 20.387
            },
            {
              "text": "Silver, who walked beside the boy, smiled and spoke in a very friendly voice.",
              "audioStart": 21.25,
              "audioEnd": 25.788
            },
            {
              "text": "Although Jim trusted the man somewhat, he knew that trouble could happen at any moment.",
              "audioStart": 26.65,
              "audioEnd": 30.938
            },
            {
              "text": "They crossed a small stream and climbed up a high hill where the trees grew thick.",
              "audioStart": 31.8,
              "audioEnd": 35.562
            },
            {
              "text": "Everything around them was silent, yet a strange feeling remained in the air.",
              "audioStart": 36.425,
              "audioEnd": 40.15
            },
            {
              "text": "Many hours passed while they walked further into the deep forest.",
              "audioStart": 41.013,
              "audioEnd": 44.263
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun moved slowly across the sky above the green leaves.",
              "audioStart": 45.125,
              "audioEnd": 48.288
            },
            {
              "text": "Every step brought them closer to the end of their long journey.",
              "audioStart": 49.15,
              "audioEnd": 52.1
            },
            {
              "text": "The heavy task was far from finished, but hope grew stronger in their hearts.",
              "audioStart": 52.962,
              "audioEnd": 57.062
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Suddenly, a loud sound came from behind the green plants near the path.",
              "audioStart": 57.925,
              "audioEnd": 61.775
            },
            {
              "text": "Silver stopped and looked closely while Jim held his breath in pure fear.",
              "audioStart": 62.638,
              "audioEnd": 66.287
            },
            {
              "text": "A wild man, who wore clothes made from old animal skins, jumped out into the open space.",
              "audioStart": 67.15,
              "audioEnd": 72.325
            },
            {
              "text": "The strange person shouted something which neither of them could understand at first.",
              "audioStart": 73.188,
              "audioEnd": 77.237
            },
            {
              "text": "The man ran toward them, but he stopped when he saw the friendly face of Silver.",
              "audioStart": 78.1,
              "audioEnd": 82.138
            },
            {
              "text": "He fell down upon his knees and began to talk about a long and quiet life on the island.",
              "audioStart": 83,
              "audioEnd": 87.55
            },
            {
              "text": "Because he had lived alone for years, his voice sounded rough and strange.",
              "audioStart": 88.412,
              "audioEnd": 92.263
            },
            {
              "text": "He promised that he would help the group if they took him back home.",
              "audioStart": 93.125,
              "audioEnd": 96.125
            },
            {
              "text": "The group listened to every word with great attention during this strange moment.",
              "audioStart": 96.987,
              "audioEnd": 100.713
            },
            {
              "text": "Jim felt that this person could be trusted despite his wild appearance.",
              "audioStart": 101.575,
              "audioEnd": 105.125
            },
            {
              "text": "The stranger explained how he survived on the island for many years.",
              "audioStart": 105.987,
              "audioEnd": 109.487
            },
            {
              "text": "He told them that he knew every part of the land.",
              "audioStart": 110.35,
              "audioEnd": 112.625
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Jim listened carefully to the story while the wind blew gently through the leaves.",
              "audioStart": 113.487,
              "audioEnd": 117.3
            },
            {
              "text": "Though the situation was difficult, this new friend might provide the right way out of danger.",
              "audioStart": 118.162,
              "audioEnd": 122.75
            },
            {
              "text": "They agreed to bring him along, and the small team continued their journey toward the high ground.",
              "audioStart": 123.612,
              "audioEnd": 128.312
            },
            {
              "text": "Silver looked at the man and asked him about the secret path.",
              "audioStart": 129.175,
              "audioEnd": 132.287
            },
            {
              "text": "If they followed him closely, they would reach the end without any problem.",
              "audioStart": 133.15,
              "audioEnd": 136.762
            },
            {
              "text": "The group walked together through the green forest under the bright sun.",
              "audioStart": 137.625,
              "audioEnd": 141.088
            },
            {
              "text": "Silver talked quietly with the stranger about the island and the dangerous men.",
              "audioStart": 141.95,
              "audioEnd": 145.8
            },
            {
              "text": "They knew that time was short and that danger was still near.",
              "audioStart": 146.662,
              "audioEnd": 149.463
            },
            {
              "text": "However, confidence was rising among all the members of the team.",
              "audioStart": 150.325,
              "audioEnd": 153.85
            },
            {
              "text": "Nothing could stop them now that they had found such a useful guide.",
              "audioStart": 154.713,
              "audioEnd": 157.887
            },
            {
              "text": "The wild man pointed toward a distant part of the island where the gold was hidden.",
              "audioStart": 158.75,
              "audioEnd": 162.537
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Hours passed as they continued moving forward through the thick trees.",
              "audioStart": 163.4,
              "audioEnd": 166.912
            },
            {
              "text": "The map was checked again to ensure they were on the right path.",
              "audioStart": 167.775,
              "audioEnd": 170.725
            },
            {
              "text": "Jim held the paper tightly in his hand while looking at the surrounding nature.",
              "audioStart": 171.588,
              "audioEnd": 175.3
            },
            {
              "text": "They prepared themselves for the final challenge before the sun went down.",
              "audioStart": 176.162,
              "audioEnd": 179.875
            },
            {
              "text": "Hope and confidence filled their minds as they approached the final goal.",
              "audioStart": 180.738,
              "audioEnd": 184.088
            },
            {
              "text": "The air was warm, and the wind moved softly through the high branches.",
              "audioStart": 184.95,
              "audioEnd": 188.562
            },
            {
              "text": "Each member of the team felt ready to face whatever came next.",
              "audioStart": 189.425,
              "audioEnd": 192.8
            },
            {
              "text": "They knew that success was possible if they stayed together.",
              "audioStart": 193.662,
              "audioEnd": 196.5
            },
            {
              "text": "The journey had been long, but the end was finally in sight.",
              "audioStart": 197.363,
              "audioEnd": 200.575
            },
            {
              "text": "They took a short rest before making the final push toward the gold.",
              "audioStart": 201.438,
              "audioEnd": 204.825
            }
          ]
        }
